  (text "Power: the button, the MCU (PWR_HOLD) or USB each raise PWR_EN. Releasing the button with"
    (at 59.69 185 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "340436fc-7ba4-4c96-9cb0-5d0ae595df5c"))

  (text "PWR_HOLD low turns the device off. A reset drops PWR_HOLD, so a crash turns it off."
    (at 55.88 189 0)
    (effects
